{# DeD Cum — disposition guidance for witnesses. Eligibility via
   get_ded_cum_any (module-owned companion decorator, REV-132b): a marked
   actor in the observer's cell.

   REV-178c Leg 2 (user-ruled) — THE AROUSAL DEBAND: the mechanical 3-band
   tiering is RETIRED (funeral receipts, below). Retired surfaces and what
   each retirement does:
   (1) the tier-3 branch ("run hot -- open admiration and appetite; you do
       not bother hiding your fascination") — GONE;
   (2) the tier-2 branch ("be intrigued -- with scandalized curiosity and
       fascination, openly staring") — GONE;
   (3) the tier-1 branch ("be taken aback -- shock, disgust, or scandalized
       disapproval") — GONE;
   (4) the TIER-0 SILENCE RULE ("tier-0 = silence", the anti-obsession
       floor keyed to arousal) — GONE: a low-arousal witness may now also
       react (or not) per the LLM's context judgment; arousal no longer
       gates WHETHER the fragment renders at all.
   Effect on the surface: this fragment now renders for ANY eligible
   observer near a marked actor, carrying ONE context suggestion instead of
   three band-steered dispositions. Arousal REMAINS a fact in the pack
   wherever it already rides (the A17 band+raw discipline -- the bio/state
   decorators are untouched); what is retired here is the STEERING, not the
   facts. The single suggestion line is REGISTER DRAFT (the user's pen).
   REV-133 null-hardening riders retained: this lane's actor variable is
   npc.UUID (0050/0550 precedent); no render_mode gate; numeric reads
   guarded. First enabled render IS the probe (clean = LIVE; error box =
   escalate). #}
{% set dedany = get_ded_cum_any(npc.UUID) %}
{% if dedany and dedany.any %}
When reacting to the cum-soaked person, let your own arousal color your reaction -- characters with higher arousal may find the visible cum, applied or seen, more alluring; decide your reaction per the context.
{% endif %}
